    <panel_attributes>Relationships inside each focused view are drawn here. Dependencies between the views
(for example the facade and controller references to services, tools to services,
and «create» of contract types) are omitted for legibility; the focused class-diagram
views draw every one of them. Simple accessors are omitted; Optional results are [0..1].
